{"id":"n36974-1-8","stage":5,"title":"구독 · 订阅","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n36974-1-8-1","ko":"매일 아침마다 신문을 사서 보려니 좀 귀찮네요.","zh":"每天早上都要去买报纸来看，有点麻烦呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"매일","meaning":"每日，天天","explanation":"매일：每日，天天","readings":[{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58103","senseId":"1","lemma":"매일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아침마다","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨；마다：表示“每、每逢”。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"신문을","meaning":"报纸","explanation":"신문：报纸；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"신문","audio":"/audio/bcf27ef578d25dc71d55.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65337","senseId":"1","lemma":"신문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사서","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보려니","meaning":"表示先做前面所指的行为，再考虑后来的事情。","explanation":"보다：表示先做前面所指的行为，再考虑后来的事情。；려니：说明正要或打算做某事时所遇到的情况、想法或困难。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"5","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"귀찮네요.","meaning":"麻烦，厌烦","explanation":"귀찮다：麻烦，厌烦；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"귀찮다","audio":"/audio/133acb4be52ff131970f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37050","senseId":"1","lemma":"귀찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d5d6a44c9a892452","term":"매일","zh":"每日，天天","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3","entryId":"58103","definition":"一天一天的每一天。","pronunciation":["매ː일"]},{"id":"2fdd736548d881c6","term":"아침","zh":"早上，早晨","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3","entryId":"27368","definition":"从天渐渐变亮到太阳出来，一天的事情开始的时间。","pronunciation":["아침"]},{"id":"bcf27ef578d25dc7","term":"신문","zh":"报纸","audio":"/audio/bcf27ef578d25dc71d55.mp3","entryId":"65337","definition":"告知世上新发生的事件的定期刊物。","pronunciation":["신문"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"表示先做前面所指的行为，再考虑后来的事情。","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"表示先做前面所指的行为，再考虑后来的事情。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"133acb4be52ff131","term":"귀찮다","zh":"麻烦，厌烦","audio":"/audio/133acb4be52ff131970f.mp3","entryId":"37050","definition":"不喜欢，讨厌。","pronunciation":["귀찬타"]}],"audio":"/audio/c2de7e2e74327be5bce7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n36974-1-8-2","ko":"구독을 해서 보면 더 편하지 않겠어요?","zh":"订阅了的话不是会更方便吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"구독을","meaning":"订阅","explanation":"구독：订阅；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"구독","audio":"/audio/be28ffb73ae6b693be18.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36974","senseId":"1","lemma":"구독","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해서","meaning":"因为，由于","explanation":"하다：因为，由于；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"18","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보면","meaning":"阅读，看","explanation":"보다：阅读，看；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"3","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"편하지","meaning":"方便","explanation":"편하다：方便；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"편하다","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71334","senseId":"2","lemma":"편하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않겠어요?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"be28ffb73ae6b693","term":"구독","zh":"订阅","audio":"/audio/be28ffb73ae6b693be18.mp3","entryId":"36974","definition":"购买书籍、杂志或报纸等来阅读。","pronunciation":["구독"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"因为，由于","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示原因。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"阅读，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"读书籍、报纸、地图中的字、图、符号等而理解内容。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"33bf1e37d2739b22","term":"편하다","zh":"方便","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3","entryId":"71334","definition":"容易而简便。","pronunciation":["편하다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/3e5ea0f1a260852d2d34.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.345,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=36974","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":159,"sequenceScore":3.1717,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["每天早上都要去买报纸来看，有点麻烦呢。","订阅了的话不是会更方便吗？","衣服怎么全湿成这样了？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["每天早上都要去买报纸来看，有点麻烦呢。","订阅了的话不是会更方便吗？","衣服怎么全湿成这样了？"],"answer":1}]}
